            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          }
        ],
        "text": "The authors report increasing and saturating stabilizer work with beta in the transverse-field Ising model, enhanced nonstabilizerness near the transition, and richer moment information than a single stabilizer Renyi index. The supplement qualifies the peak description by reporting a broad nearly saturated plateau at beta=100. This is an unverified author-claim candidate."
      }
    ],
    "conditions": [
      {
        "condition_id": "condition:ising-moment-scan-0",
        "origin": "SOURCE_RECONSTRUCTED",
        "source_span_refs": [
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:a17c787fb0e5621170c3a5d81bf1f1f52b5470eea7e8556769d1fc40dea9ab15",
            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-db635458e365-span-1534-1593",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          },
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:c8f63099217454a24edf1ca026e9581aebb5c20af8a330be8fc864769cbf32f0",
            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-db635458e365-span-2681-2701",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          }
        ],
        "statement": "The model is the one-dimensional transverse-field Ising Hamiltonian H=-g sum_i sigma_i^z sigma_(i+1)^z-h sum_i sigma_i^x."
      },
      {
        "condition_id": "condition:ising-moment-scan-1",
        "origin": "SOURCE_RECONSTRUCTED",
        "source_span_refs": [
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:a17c787fb0e5621170c3a5d81bf1f1f52b5470eea7e8556769d1fc40dea9ab15",
            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-db635458e365-span-1534-1593",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          },
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:c8f63099217454a24edf1ca026e9581aebb5c20af8a330be8fc864769cbf32f0",
            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-db635458e365-span-2681-2701",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          }
        ],
        "statement": "Beta is a Pauli-moment resolving parameter rather than physical temperature."
      },
      {
        "condition_id": "condition:ising-moment-scan-2",
        "origin": "SOURCE_RECONSTRUCTED",
        "source_span_refs": [
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:a17c787fb0e5621170c3a5d81bf1f1f52b5470eea7e8556769d1fc40dea9ab15",
            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-db635458e365-span-1534-1593",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
